(7735950, 1275316, 29535, '<td valign="top">I love what you''ve done with this. Perhaps in another image the snow, grain and branches would bug me but here they all combine to create a wonderful shot with complexity. Great job!</td>', 'I love what you''ve done with this. Perhaps in another image the snow, grain and branches would bug me but here they all combine to create a wonderful shot with complexity. Great job!', '2023-01-02 13:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
