(7735976, 1275085, 83313, '<td valign="top">Trying to get better about leaving explanations on my low votes. I might be picking up from the title what you are trying to illustrate. You probably had a good day in the park and the evening light was nice. However, nothing really draws my eye as the subject, I''m afraid. I just don''t know what you are trying to show me with this scene. This comes off to me as a well composed snapshot. Sorry.</td>', 'Trying to get better about leaving explanations on my low votes. I might be picking up from the title what you are trying to illustrate. You probably had a good day in the park and the evening light was nice. However, nothing really draws my eye as the subject, I''m afraid. I just don''t know what you are trying to show me with this scene. This comes off to me as a well composed snapshot. Sorry.', '2023-01-02 18:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
